  "description": "The phrase 'split my dick' is a crude, vulgar metaphor used to degrade and insult. It relies on real-world knowledge of offensive language and bodily references to convey its abusive nature. This type of language is commonly used in misogynistic and transphobic slurs to demean individuals, particularly women and transgender people, by focusing on their bodies in a degrading way.",
